message: "If you use ReversePort in research or teaching, please cite it like this."
type: software
title: "ReversePort"
abstract: >-
  Reverse engineering and porting toolkit for AI coding agents: an MCP server, CLI, skills and Claude Code plugin
  that read Godot packs, Unity IL2CPP, .NET and native binaries, compare builds, keep proof cases, and port games
  between Godot, Unity, Unreal, three.js and languages with parity checks.
authors:
